config XIAOMI_METIS
	tristate "Xiaomi METIS stock reconstruction"
	depends on ARM64 && ANDROID_VENDOR_HOOKS && ANDROID_VENDOR_OEM_DATA
	default n
	help
	  Experimental reconstruction from dash OS3.0.305 METIS. Original
	  defects are retained. Stock machine-entry bridges are saved, while
	  canonical C/MODVERSIONS contracts and genuine provider integration
	  remain unresolved; see RECONSTRUCTION.md. Leaf source
	  metadata does not activate parent traversal or package the module.
	  Native compilation, KMI/CFI, loading and runtime remain untested.
